1
00:00:17,708 --> 00:00:20,333
长官 我们确认了瓦特博士
Sir, we have confirmation that Dr. Watts

2
00:00:20,375 --> 00:00:21,708
已经逃出了基地总部了
has escaped military headquarters

3
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:23,458
是馨德‧秋协助他逃离的
with the assistance of Cinder Fall.

4
00:00:24,916 --> 00:00:26,416
杰克·雪倪 还在我们的监护中
We do have Jacques Schnee in custody.

5
00:00:26,458 --> 00:00:28,916
他怎么样关我屁事
I don't give a damn about Jacques Schnee.

6
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,458
另外两个呢?
What about the other two?

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:36,875
长官 布兰温和休躲过了我们的抓捕
Sir? Branwen and Hill have evaded capture.

8
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,625
但是我们监控了所有出口
But we are monitoring every exit,

9
00:00:39,958 --> 00:00:41,666
所以他们肯定还在基地里
so they must still be inside the compound.

10
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,958
举高双手 我们会把你们转移到-
Hands Up! We're moving you to another--

11
00:00:44,333 --> 00:00:45,375
可恶!
Damn it!

12
00:00:48,958 --> 00:00:50,750
全面搜索 把他们揪出来
Search everywhere for them.

13
00:00:50,791 --> 00:00:53,333
在你回来的时候
Do not return to this office until

14
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:55,916
我要知道你已经抓到克罗‧布兰温了
you have Qrow Branwen in custody.

15
00:00:56,166 --> 00:00:57,375
当然 长官
Of course, sir.

16
00:01:06,875 --> 00:01:08,166
状况报告 我们的
What's the status of our--

17
00:01:59,583 --> 00:02:01,166
大家都没事吧?
Is everyone all right?

18
00:02:01,208 --> 00:02:02,833
我们没受伤
No injuries here.

19
00:02:03,875 --> 00:02:04,458
什么?
What?

20
00:02:05,208 --> 00:02:09,500
他们 他们还在里面
They, they were still inside.

21
00:02:25,833 --> 00:02:28,041
目标已破坏 做得好
Target destroyed. Good work.

22
00:02:28,083 --> 00:02:29,500
但是没时间庆祝了
But no time to celebrate.

23
00:02:30,250 --> 00:02:31,875
马上回来学院
Return to the Academy at once.

24
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:33,416
我们有新状况了
We've got a new problem.

25
00:02:35,333 --> 00:02:37,833
但那不是我们做的
But, that wasn't us.

26
00:02:39,875 --> 00:02:41,375
那么我们就当面向他报告吧
Then we can tell him in person.

27
00:02:41,666 --> 00:02:43,458
炸弹运回去 我们要走了
Load it back up, we're leaving.

28
00:02:57,791 --> 00:03:00,875
有 有人回应吗
Did... Did anyone respond?

29
00:03:03,166 --> 00:03:03,916
没有
No.

30
00:03:05,916 --> 00:03:08,291
不过嘛 她会复活的
Well, she'll come back.

31
00:03:08,583 --> 00:03:10,541
在这之前我们要整个计划
In the interim we need a plan.

32
00:03:11,541 --> 00:03:12,291
计划?
Plan?

33
00:03:12,583 --> 00:03:14,375
计划还是一样
The plan hasn't changed.

34
00:03:14,791 --> 00:03:18,166
我要把PennyPolendina的少女力量扯出来
I'm going to rip the maiden power out of Penny Polendina

35
00:03:18,416 --> 00:03:20,458
而你要把她带到我面前
because you're going to bring her to me.

36
00:03:22,041 --> 00:03:23,750
不好意思?
I beg your pardon?

37
00:03:24,625 --> 00:03:28,125
你的信息里说了 你可以控制Penny
You said in your message that you have control over Penny.

38
00:03:28,166 --> 00:03:30,791
我说的是我控制住她了
I said I had Penny under control.

39
00:03:30,833 --> 00:03:33,083
不是我能隔空命令她
Not that I could telekinetically force her to

40
00:03:33,125 --> 00:03:34,291
做什么就做什么
do whatever I want.

41
00:03:35,125 --> 00:03:35,875
什么?
What?

42
00:03:36,166 --> 00:03:39,750
我在她身上植入了病毒 蠢材
I implanted a virus in her, you dimwit.

43
00:03:40,083 --> 00:03:41,958
她现在的行为固定了
She's on a set path now.

44
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:43,833
至少本来应该是的
At least she should be.

45
00:03:44,458 --> 00:03:45,875
虽然我很不情愿
As much as I hate to admit it,

46
00:03:45,916 --> 00:03:47,208
但无可否认她体内有一部分
there seems to be some part of her

47
00:03:47,291 --> 00:03:48,916
能够反抗病毒
capable of resisting.

48
00:03:49,333 --> 00:03:51,166
不过 要让她的铁石之躯
Regardless, it's only a matter of time

49
00:03:51,208 --> 00:03:53,791
完全沦陷也只是时间问题
before her mechanical body succumbs to the virus.

50
00:03:54,166 --> 00:03:56,666
到时她就会打開宝库然后自灭
She'll open the vault, then she'll destroy herself

51
00:03:56,708 --> 00:03:59,166
于是我们就解决Penny了
and our little Penny problem will be done.

52
00:03:59,208 --> 00:04:01,291
她会自毁是什么意思?
What do you mean she'll destroy herself?

53
00:04:01,333 --> 00:04:04,208
她死了我还怎么得到她的力量?
How am I supposed to take her power if she's dead?

54
00:04:04,250 --> 00:04:05,875
你到现在还没察觉是真行
You know it's impressive that you

55
00:04:05,916 --> 00:04:08,666
但我不是你的打工仔
haven't realized this yet but I don't work for you.

56
00:04:12,291 --> 00:04:13,041
拜托
Please.

57
00:04:13,541 --> 00:04:15,791
你别像威胁其他人那样威胁我啊
You can't just threaten me like everyone else.

58
00:04:16,375 --> 00:04:19,291
亚瑟 你觉得自己很聪明对吧
You think you're so clever, don't you Arthur?

59
00:04:19,333 --> 00:04:21,250
塞伦的命令是让你把我带回去
Salem sent you to bring me back.

60
00:04:21,291 --> 00:04:26,125
她现在不在 但是我想我们
Salem isn't here right now, but I think we can still come

61
00:04:26,166 --> 00:04:29,041
可以趁她复活的时候好好谋划
up with a plan while she's pulling herself together.

62
00:04:30,791 --> 00:04:32,958
首先 我会看着你掉入
First, I'm going to watch you plummet

63
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,375
毫无亮点的结局
to an unremarkable end.

64
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:37,458
然后我会烧出一条去宝库的路
And then I'm going to burn a path directly

65
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:42,291
在那里等着 把那个魔法人偶撕碎
to the vault where I will wait to tear that magical puppet

66
00:04:42,333 --> 00:04:47,708
把我的东西拿到手
to pieces and take what is mine.

67
00:04:55,333 --> 00:04:59,000
哦 你果然又要这么做
Oh, of course you are because

68
00:04:59,041 --> 00:05:00,833
反正你每次都是这样子的
that's just what you do.

69
00:05:00,875 --> 00:05:02,041
对吧?
Isn't it?

70
00:05:03,416 --> 00:05:05,833
那结果怎么样了?
And how has that worked out for you?

71
00:05:06,458 --> 00:05:09,125
你闯进芙莉雅房间里 以为能打过
You stormed into Fria's room thinking you can take

72
00:05:09,166 --> 00:05:11,541
埃隆伍德的金牌打手和战争机器
on Ironwood's top fighter and war machine.

73
00:05:12,375 --> 00:05:13,250
但是你打不过
But you couldn't.

74
00:05:13,625 --> 00:05:15,916
然后那部机器还成了冬之少女
And that machine became the Winter Maiden.

75
00:05:15,958 --> 00:05:19,208
还有你跟蕾文‧布兰温做的那个交易
Oh, and let's not forget your deal with Raven Branwen.

76
00:05:19,666 --> 00:05:21,625
把你的所有敌人集中到一块
Get all your enemies in one place

77
00:05:21,666 --> 00:05:23,416
就为了个复仇的机会
so you'd have a shot at revenge.

78
00:05:23,458 --> 00:05:28,333
如果早先有人警告你 那是个可悲的主意
If only someone could have warned you against such a miserable idea.

79
00:05:28,625 --> 00:05:31,041
哦等等 是我啊
Oh wait, I did.

80
00:05:31,208 --> 00:05:36,333
但是你自作主张擅自行动 连自己的本职都搞砸了
But you pushed ahead and you lost it when all you had to do was your job.

81
00:05:37,125 --> 00:05:42,166
你觉得自己因为受过苦就可以为所欲为 真是不知天高地厚
You think you're entitled to everything just because you've suffered, but suffering isn't enough.

82
00:05:42,458 --> 00:05:45,000
光强大有什么用 你得有脑子啊
You can't just be strong, you have to be smart.

83
00:05:45,041 --> 00:05:48,291
你觉得这是自己应得的?你配吗?!
You can't just be deserving, you have to be worthy.

84
00:05:48,333 --> 00:05:51,916
你所做的一切都只会让人头痛!
But all you have ever been is a bloody migraine!

85
00:06:26,750 --> 00:06:27,625
Blake?
Blake?

86
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,750
Yang! 你还好吗
Yang! Are you okay?

87
00:06:29,791 --> 00:06:30,958
你在哪
Where are you?

88
00:06:32,125 --> 00:06:33,833
我们没事
Yeah, we're fine.

89
00:06:34,708 --> 00:06:35,958
你们没事吧
Is everyone there all right?

90
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:38,000
我们..还活着
We're... alive.

91
00:06:38,333 --> 00:06:39,500
这样都算好了
This'll help though.

92
00:06:39,541 --> 00:06:41,583
伙计们!他们没事
Guys! They're okay.

93
00:06:41,833 --> 00:06:43,833
我们拿她怎么办呢
What do we do about her?

94
00:06:49,041 --> 00:06:49,583
黑泽尔
Hazel?

95
00:06:51,666 --> 00:06:53,000
我给你们传送地图
I'm sending you a map.

96
00:06:53,458 --> 00:06:55,208
你们现在在农田区
You're in the agricultural area.

97
00:06:55,416 --> 00:06:58,666
到达这处接入点 就能进入红线地铁隧道
Just head to this access point to reach the red line subway tunnel

98
00:06:58,708 --> 00:07:00,500
再沿着我给你的路线前进
then follow the route I've drawn for you.

99
00:07:00,541 --> 00:07:01,041
明白了
Got it.

100
00:07:01,458 --> 00:07:02,583
等会见
We'll see you soon.

101
00:07:04,958 --> 00:07:06,375
你开玩笑吧
You can't be serious.

102
00:07:06,416 --> 00:07:08,208
你想和她合作?
You want us to work with her?

103
00:07:08,250 --> 00:07:10,666
我只是觉得这样最合理
I'm just saying it makes the most sense.

104
00:07:10,708 --> 00:07:12,958
我们都是塞仑的敌人 她也是
We're all enemies of Salem, including her.

105
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,291
不 其实我和金毛一个想法
No, I'm with Blondie.

106
00:07:14,333 --> 00:07:16,375
你们不喜欢我 我不喜欢你们
You don't like me, I don't like you.

107
00:07:16,416 --> 00:07:19,625
不然我们就这样分开 然后永不相见
So how about we just part ways and you never have to see me again.

108
00:07:19,666 --> 00:07:21,541
你哪都别想去
You're not going anywhere.

109
00:07:21,875 --> 00:07:23,416
看看你做的一切
Not after everything you've done.

110
00:07:23,458 --> 00:07:25,833
我们不能依恐惧行事
We can't let all of our actions stem from fear.

111
00:07:26,250 --> 00:07:28,708
如果她能帮我们 我们就得考虑
If she could help us, I think we should consider it.

112
00:07:29,083 --> 00:07:32,083
她就是我变成这样的原因之一啊
She is part of the reason I have this.

113
00:07:32,500 --> 00:07:35,083
我怎么能就这样原谅她
I'm not going to just forgive her.

114
00:07:35,833 --> 00:07:37,666
发生在信标的一切
Everything that happened at Beacon.

115
00:07:37,708 --> 00:07:40,666
欺骗我们 戏弄我们
She lied to us, tricked us.

116
00:07:40,708 --> 00:07:42,291
她很危险
She is dangerous.

117
00:07:42,875 --> 00:07:44,375
你不必原谅她的
You don't have to forgive her.

118
00:07:44,875 --> 00:07:46,541
你有一切理由去有这感受
You have every reason to feel that way.

119
00:07:47,125 --> 00:07:50,166
但给她第二次机会吧
Just maybe give her a second chance.

120
00:07:50,583 --> 00:07:55,291
我们今天已经从一个不大信任的人手里得到很大帮助了
We've already gotten quite a bit of help today from someone we don't exactly trust right now.

121
00:07:55,583 --> 00:07:56,958
你是说奥兹平?
Do you mean Ozpin?

122
00:07:59,166 --> 00:08:00,166
我就感觉到
I had a feeling.

123
00:08:00,208 --> 00:08:00,833
什么?
Wait, what?

124
00:08:00,875 --> 00:08:01,708
奥兹回来了?
Oz is back?

125
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:04,458
我知道你们的情绪 但他救了我的命
I know how you feel but he saved my life.

126
00:08:05,458 --> 00:08:07,208
我们被折磨时 是他扛下来的
When we were tortured, he took it.

127
00:08:08,041 --> 00:08:09,583
这样我就不必受苦
So I wouldn't have to.

128
00:08:14,041 --> 00:08:15,625
他信予我这件器物
He entrusted me with this.

129
00:08:16,041 --> 00:08:19,000
以及储存在此内的巨大能量
And the massive amount of power he had stored up in it.

130
00:08:19,916 --> 00:08:25,000
他将一辈子又一辈子的力量储存在这手杖里
Kinetic energy that he spent lifetime after lifetime accumulating in the cane he built.

131
00:08:25,416 --> 00:08:28,083
所以你是这样做到的
So that's how you did that?

132
00:08:28,916 --> 00:08:30,875
用尽一切储存的力量
Using all of the stored up power.

133
00:08:31,416 --> 00:08:33,541
不是所有,是大部分
Not all, but most.

134
00:08:34,333 --> 00:08:36,666
我们必须谨慎运用剩下的力量
We have to be careful with how we use the rest.

135
00:08:37,708 --> 00:08:40,875
他信任我的判断 然后救了我们
He trusted my judgment and it saved us.

136
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:43,333
我不能辜负这份信任
I want to reciprocate that trust.

137
00:08:43,375 --> 00:08:47,833
虽然还有很多要搞清楚 但奥兹确实想帮忙
There's a lot to sort out, but Oz really wants to help.

138
00:08:50,583 --> 00:08:52,000
谢谢你 奥斯卡
Thank you, Oscar.

139
00:09:15,041 --> 00:09:16,625
擎天人全在这
All of Atlas is down here.

140
00:09:30,208 --> 00:09:32,208
我已经知道你能干什么 翡翠
I've seen what you can do, Emerald.

141
00:09:33,416 --> 00:09:37,958
无论这战斗如何结束 我们真用得上你这样的人
However this fight ends,we could really use someone like you.

142
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:48,833
是时候了
It's about time.

143
00:09:49,458 --> 00:09:51,583
我们今天对塞仑出了重拳
While we dealt a decisive blow to Salem today--

144
00:09:51,625 --> 00:09:53,625
其实不是我们的弹头 长官
Actually that wasn't our payload, sir.

145
00:09:54,041 --> 00:09:55,708
我把它带回来了
I brought it back with us.

146
00:09:57,625 --> 00:09:58,500
那是谁办到的
Then who could have?

147
00:10:02,208 --> 00:10:03,291
但你仍然有它
But you still have it.

148
00:10:04,416 --> 00:10:05,875
这会有用的
This may be useful.

149
00:10:07,583 --> 00:10:09,250
Penny仍然没有到达宝库
Penny still hasn't come to the Vault,

150
00:10:09,291 --> 00:10:12,791
意味着瓦特要么无能 要么背叛了我们
meaning Watts was either incompetent or he betrayed us.

151
00:10:13,125 --> 00:10:14,916
我们现在也无法知道
At this point, we'll never know.

152
00:10:15,916 --> 00:10:18,625
馨德‧秋袭击了指挥中心 并带着他逃了
Cinder Fall has attacked command and escaped with him.

153
00:10:20,041 --> 00:10:21,916
我们失去的还不止这些
And that's not all we've lost

154
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:23,791
长官?
Sir?

155
00:10:25,541 --> 00:10:28,333
克罗和罗宾也逃走了
Qrow and Robyn have also escaped.

156
00:10:32,708 --> 00:10:34,375
塞仑的怪物被摧毁了
Salem's creature was destroyed,

157
00:10:35,875 --> 00:10:37,583
但这并不代表我们彻底阻止了她
but that doesn't mean we've stopped her.

158
00:10:38,416 --> 00:10:43,583
她会回归 并会用尽她的一切来对付我们 直到最后
She will return and shelwill throw everything she has at us until there is nothing left.

159
00:10:43,625 --> 00:10:46,666
而我们现在已经非常接近这个状况
And we are perilously close to that already.

160
00:10:47,666 --> 00:10:50,291
我需要冬之少女 立刻需要
I need the Winter Maiden, now.

161
00:10:50,333 --> 00:10:52,916
这是拯救擎天的唯一办法
It's the only way Atlas can survive.

162
00:10:57,000 --> 00:11:00,000
雪倪 把Arc Ren 和Xiao Long带来
Schnee, bring me Arc, Ren, and Xiao Long.

163
00:11:01,458 --> 00:11:03,000
为什么 长官?
What for, sir?

164
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:07,875
我本来抓住了克罗
I had Qrow in my hands and I didn't do

165
00:11:07,916 --> 00:11:09,166
但我没有把握机会做我该做的
what needed to be done.

166
00:11:10,208 --> 00:11:12,208
我不会再犯这个错误了
I will not make that mistake again.

167
00:11:15,833 --> 00:11:16,416
我知道
I know.

168
00:11:17,208 --> 00:11:18,875
没有早点想到这个主意我也很羞愧
I'm ashamed I didn't think of it earlier.

169
00:11:20,250 --> 00:11:23,000
用她朋友们的性命做筹码
Leveraging the lives of her friends is the only way to

170
00:11:23,083 --> 00:11:24,291
是唯一能让Penny跟我们谈判的条件
make Penny listen to reason.

171
00:11:25,833 --> 00:11:26,458
长官
Sir.

172
00:11:27,083 --> 00:11:30,375
很抱歉 他们不在我们手里
I'm sorry, but we don't have them.

173
00:11:31,208 --> 00:11:33,500
雪倪特工让他们走了
Operative Schnee let them go.

174
00:11:36,125 --> 00:11:38,000
你做了什么?
You what?

175
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:40,416
温特允许他们
Winter allowed them to go on board

176
00:11:40,458 --> 00:11:42,583
进入那个怪物去救他们的朋友
the creature to rescue their friend

177
00:11:43,041 --> 00:11:45,500
而他们再也没回来
and they never came back.

178
00:11:56,291 --> 00:11:58,833
他们是我们最后的机会
They were our last chance.

179
00:11:59,583 --> 00:12:03,708
现在 现在我什么都没有了
Now. Now I have nothing.

180
00:12:12,583 --> 00:12:14,916
长官! 我们雷达检测到了
Sir! We are detecting non-military

181
00:12:14,958 --> 00:12:17,166
非军方的空舰 数量非常多!
ships on radar, dozens of them!

182
00:12:17,916 --> 00:12:20,458
空舰?谁的?
Ships? Whose ships?

183
00:12:21,333 --> 00:12:24,208
看起来像是雪倪尘晶公司的运输舰 长官
They appear to be Schnee Dust Company freighters, sir

184
00:12:25,125 --> 00:12:26,583
他们在朝着曼特城前进
They're heading straight for Mantle.

185
00:12:31,583 --> 00:12:32,416
Weiss
Weiss,

186
00:12:33,083 --> 00:12:34,250
是吗
I see.

187
00:12:36,583 --> 00:12:39,250
他们想要拯救曼特城
They're trying to save Mantle.

188
00:12:42,583 --> 00:12:45,083
这一直都是为了曼特城 对不对?
This has always been about Mantle, hasn't it?

189
00:12:49,541 --> 00:12:50,833
我得打个电话
I need to make a call.

190
00:13:05,291 --> 00:13:05,958
是谁?
Who is it?

191
00:13:06,708 --> 00:13:07,875
有人存活下来了吗?
Did someone survive?

192
00:13:24,291 --> 00:13:25,583
我也想你了
I missed you too.

193
00:13:45,916 --> 00:13:47,583
Nora在哪?
Where's Nora?

194
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,000
奥斯卡 你
Oscar, you--

195
00:13:58,208 --> 00:14:01,000
不 她没问题 我可以
No, she's okay, I can--

196
00:14:03,250 --> 00:14:05,625
孩子们 你们送来的运输舰到了
Kids, the cargo ships you sent just made it

197
00:14:05,666 --> 00:14:07,208
但他们并不是单独来的
but they're not alone.

198
00:14:07,250 --> 00:14:09,583
梅?你在说什么?
May? What are you talking about?

199
00:14:09,875 --> 00:14:11,958
我的天 快跑!
Oh my gods, run!

200
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:14,166
各位 跑进矿井里!
Everyone, into the mines

201
00:14:17,458 --> 00:14:18,250
那些是不是...?
Were those....?

202
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:25,958
这是一条紧急广播
This is an emergency CCT broadcast.

203
00:14:36,708 --> 00:14:37,791
发生了什么?
What's going on?

204
00:14:37,833 --> 00:14:40,833
那些空舰本来是要去救人的
Those ships, they were going to save people.

205
00:14:40,875 --> 00:14:41,541
为什么会
Why would-

206
00:14:44,041 --> 00:14:46,458
我一直承诺我会从想要毁灭这里的人手中
I have always promised to defend this kingdom,

207
00:14:46,916 --> 00:14:52,416
保护这个王国 国家的技术 国家的未来
its technology, its future, from those who would see it destroy it.

208
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:56,625
我们的敌人已经被削弱 但有一个人
Our enemy is crippled, but one individual

209
00:14:56,666 --> 00:14:59,125
仍然不愿直面情况拯救擎天
still denies Atlas its salvation.

210
00:15:00,250 --> 00:15:02,375
曼特城的守护者
e Protector of Mant

211
00:15:03,791 --> 00:15:06,916
Penny 无论你和你的朋友们在哪
Penny, wherever you and your friends are,

212
00:15:07,583 --> 00:15:08,958
我需要你听好
I need you all to listen.

213
00:15:10,166 --> 00:15:12,083
我知道曼特城对于你来说很重要
I know how much Mantle means to you.

214
00:15:12,666 --> 00:15:14,208
所以我现在要给你一个选择
So I'm going to give you a choice.

215
00:15:14,833 --> 00:15:16,708
你可以自己来擎天学院
You can bring yourself to Atlas Academy

216
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:21,041
做你该做的事 帮助我尽已所能拯救擎天
and do your duty, help me save as much of Atlas as I can

217
00:15:21,333 --> 00:15:23,625
曼特城则可以自生自灭
and Mantle will be left to fend for itself.

218
00:15:24,583 --> 00:15:28,250
或者 你可以看着我把它毁掉
Or you can all watch as I destroy it.

219
00:15:30,833 --> 00:15:33,333
我有一颗炸弹
I have one bomb.

220
00:15:34,458 --> 00:15:35,666
一颗足矣
That's all it will take.

221
00:15:36,583 --> 00:15:38,666
如果没有了曼特城
If there is no Mantle then there is no reason

222
00:15:38,708 --> 00:15:40,166
你也就失去了不合作的理由
for you not to work with me.

223
00:15:41,083 --> 00:15:43,125
我们都不想看到这个结局
Neither of us want it to come to that,

224
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:46,458
但我可以做出这件事
but one of us is willing to do it.

225
00:15:48,125 --> 00:15:50,500
如果任何人尝试做我命令以外的事
If anyone tries anything other than what I've ordered,

226
00:15:50,916 --> 00:15:53,208
曼特城就完了
Mantle is gone.

227
00:15:54,875 --> 00:15:56,333
你有一个小时的时间来给我答复
You have one hour to respond.

228
00:15:58,541 --> 00:16:01,041
我希望你对得起我赋予你的名号
I hope you live up to the title I gave you.